---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import '../../styles/legacy/promo-base.css';
import '../../styles/legacy/feature-page.css';
import '../../styles/feature-cursor.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="Online Mockup Designer | PromoPlus" description="Create professional product mockups directly in the browser with PromoPlus Online Mockup Designer." bodyClass="feature-page">
<Header active="features" />
<Fragment set:html={"<main>\n  <section class=\"feature-hero feature-shell\" aria-labelledby=\"feature-title\">\n    <div class=\"feature-hero-copy\"><p class=\"feature-kicker\">Online Mockup Designer</p><h1 id=\"feature-title\" class=\"hero-title display-title\">Create customer-ready mockups. <span>Directly in your browser.</span></h1><p class=\"feature-lede\">Create professional product mockups directly in the browser without relying on Adobe Illustrator for every proof.</p><div class=\"feature-actions\"><a class=\"button button-dark\" href=\"#designer-workflow\">See how it works <span>↓</span></a><a class=\"button button-light\" href=\"/pricing.html#custom-plan-form\">Request Custom Plan <span>↗</span></a></div></div>\n    <div class=\"designer-scene\" data-tilt-scene aria-label=\"Interactive PromoPlus mockup designer illustration\">\n      <span class=\"designer-orbit orbit-a\"></span><span class=\"designer-orbit orbit-b\"></span>\n      <article class=\"artwork-upload-card\"><small>Artwork file</small><strong>logo-final.svg</strong><span>Vector · ready to place</span><i>Uploaded</i></article>\n      <article class=\"designer-window\"><header><b>Mockup Designer</b><span>Custom Hoodie Campaign</span><em>V3</em></header><div class=\"designer-body\"><aside><button class=\"is-active\">Front</button><button>Back</button><button>Sleeve</button></aside><div class=\"designer-product\"><img src=\"../assets/features/mockup-hero-sage-model.png\" alt=\"Model wearing a sage hoodie inside the PromoPlus mockup designer\"><span class=\"placement-frame\"><i>P+</i></span></div><div class=\"designer-controls\"><small>Artwork position</small><div class=\"alignment-controls\"><i></i><i class=\"is-active\"></i><i></i></div><label>Artwork size <span>82%</span></label><div class=\"size-track\"><i></i></div><button>Generate Mockup</button></div></div><footer><span>Preview placement before sharing</span><b>Customer ready</b></footer></article>\n      <article class=\"preview-card\"><small>Customer preview</small><strong>Ready to review</strong><span>Front · Version 3</span></article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"action-ribbon\" aria-label=\"Online Mockup Designer capabilities\"><div class=\"action-ribbon-track\"><span>Upload logos</span><i>+</i><span>Position artwork</span><i>+</i><span>Resize</span><i>+</i><span>Rotate</span><i>+</i><span>Preview placements</span><i>+</i><span>Generate customer-ready mockups</span></div></section>\r\n  <section class=\"feature-editorial feature-shell\" aria-labelledby=\"editorial-title\">\n  <figure class=\"feature-photo feature-photo-designer\">\n    <img src=\"../assets/features/mockup-designer-human.png\" alt=\"Promotional product designer building a cream hoodie mockup on a laptop\">\n    <figcaption><span>Browser-based proofing</span><strong>Design where the project already lives.</strong></figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <div class=\"feature-editorial-copy\"><p class=\"feature-kicker\">Made for everyday proofs</p><h2 id=\"editorial-title\">Give your team the tools to make the next mockup.</h2><p>Simple placement work should not wait in a specialist design queue. PromoPlus keeps products, artwork, and the proof together while the team works.</p><div class=\"editorial-stat\"><strong>One workspace</strong><span>Product + artwork + placement + preview</span></div></div>\n</section>\n  <section class=\"designer-problem feature-shell\"><p class=\"feature-kicker\">The old way slows every proof</p><div class=\"problem-heading\"><h2>Professional proofs should not require Illustrator every time.</h2><p>Manual setup, repeated exports, and outsourced edits turn a simple logo placement into a long handoff. PromoPlus keeps the essential design controls in one focused browser workspace.</p></div><div class=\"problem-story-grid\"><figure class=\"problem-visual\"><img src=\"../assets/features/artwork-setup-still-life.png\" alt=\"Cream hoodie, artwork source sheet, color swatches, and placement notes arranged for a product proof\"><figcaption><span>One connected setup</span><strong>The product and source artwork stay together.</strong></figcaption></figure><div class=\"problem-comparison\"><article><small>Before</small><strong>Download. Send. Wait. Revise.</strong><span>Files move between supplier sites, email, and design software.</span></article><article><small>With PromoPlus</small><strong>Upload. Place. Preview. Share.</strong><span>The proof stays connected to the product and project.</span></article></div></div></section>\n  <section class=\"designer-workflow feature-shell\" id=\"designer-workflow\"><div class=\"feature-section-heading\"><p class=\"feature-kicker\">How it works</p><h2>From source artwork to a clear customer proof.</h2><p>One connected workspace turns the three everyday proofing steps into a focused flow.</p></div><div class=\"workflow-showcase\"><figure class=\"workflow-photo\"><img src=\"../assets/features/mockup-workflow-hands.png\" alt=\"Designer positioning artwork on a lavender sweatshirt mockup using a laptop\"><figcaption><span>Live placement</span><strong>See each adjustment on the product before sharing it.</strong></figcaption><div class=\"workflow-photo-tags\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i>Upload</i><i>Position</i><i>Generate</i></div></figure><div class=\"workflow-steps\"><article class=\"workflow-step is-active\"><span>01</span><div><h3>Upload artwork</h3><p>Add the right logo or design asset to the project once.</p></div><i>SVG</i></article><article class=\"workflow-step\"><span>02</span><div><h3>Position and refine</h3><p>Resize, rotate, and preview placement on every product side.</p></div><i>82%</i></article><article class=\"workflow-step\"><span>03</span><div><h3>Generate the mockup</h3><p>Create a professional, customer-ready proof within minutes.</p></div><i>V3</i></article></div></div></section>\n  <section class=\"feature-benefits feature-shell\"><div class=\"feature-section-heading\"><p class=\"feature-kicker\">Benefits</p><h2>A faster proof process with less design overhead.</h2><p>Everyday placements move forward without adding another tool, inbox, or unnecessary handoff.</p></div><div class=\"benefits-showcase\"><figure class=\"benefits-photo\"><img src=\"../assets/features/mockup-benefits-team.png\" alt=\"Promotional product team reviewing a tote bag and its digital mockup together\"><figcaption><span>Shared confidence</span><strong>The same proof makes sense to sales, design, and production.</strong></figcaption></figure><div class=\"benefit-grid\"><article><span>01</span><h3>Faster proof creation.</h3><p>Build a clean mockup without moving the project into a separate design workflow.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Lower artwork costs.</h3><p>Reserve specialist design time for the complex work that truly needs it.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Less outsourced dependency.</h3><p>Give internal teams the controls they need for common artwork placements.</p></article><article><span>04</span><h3>Shorter turnaround times.</h3><p>Move from product selection to customer review while context is still clear.</p></article></div></div></section>\n  <section class=\"outcome-band\"><div class=\"feature-shell outcome-layout\"><div class=\"outcome-copy\"><p class=\"feature-kicker\">Customer outcome</p><h2>Create mockups significantly faster.</h2><p>Start designing instantly, reduce repetitive manual work, and move the customer toward approval sooner.</p><div class=\"outcome-proof\"><strong>From placement to confidence</strong><span>The team sees the intended result before production begins.</span></div></div><figure class=\"outcome-photo\"><img src=\"../assets/features/approved-mockup-team.png\" alt=\"Two promotional product professionals reviewing an approved cream hoodie mockup\"><figcaption>Finished mockup, clearly reviewed.</figcaption></figure></div></section>\n  <section class=\"related-features feature-shell\"><div class=\"feature-section-heading\"><p class=\"feature-kicker\">Connected workflow</p><h2>The mockup is only the beginning.</h2></div><div class=\"related-grid\"><article><small>Starts with</small><h3>Product Catalog Integration</h3><p>Find the right product and begin designing instantly.</p><span>Coming next</span></article><article><small>Stays clear with</small><h3>Artwork Version Control</h3><p>Keep every revision and know exactly which version is current.</p><span>Planned</span></article><article><small>Moves forward through</small><h3>Customer Approval Portal</h3><p>Share the mockup through one secure online approval link.</p><span>Planned</span></article></div></section>\n  <section class=\"feature-cta feature-shell\" id=\"feature-contact\"><div><p class=\"feature-kicker\">See it with your products</p><h2>Ready to create proofs without the long design handoff?</h2></div><a class=\"press-button\" href=\"/pricing.html#custom-plan-form\">Request Custom Plan <i>↗</i></a></section>\n</main>"} />
<Footer variant="feature" label="Online Mockup Designer" top="#main-content" />
<div class="cursor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="cursor-ring"><span class="cursor-label"></span></span><span class="cursor-dot"></span></div>
<script is:inline src="/features/feature-page.js"></script>
</BaseLayout>



